Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.56,0:00:26.40,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,MAXIMUM
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.16,0:00:41.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.62,0:04:51.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.40,0:05:18.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.24,0:05:28.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Curse you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.89,0:05:59.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ka…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.52,0:06:02.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Me…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.74,0:06:10.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ha…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.12,0:06:13.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Me…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.37,0:06:17.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.65,0:06:50.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Curses!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.44,0:08:08.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.83,0:08:18.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And now it's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.84,0:08:28.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,H-He failed!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.92,0:08:30.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What do we do now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.09,0:08:37.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,C-Curses!\NHe tried to remove the Third Eye!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.22,0:08:39.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I won't let that happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.02,0:08:49.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There could be more hints in that book.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.16,0:08:56.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.13,0:09:58.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.26,0:10:46.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Glorio!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.61,0:11:03.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What? Why can't I finish things?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.74,0:11:06.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! You were amazing, Majin Kuu!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.70,0:11:07.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.66,0:11:10.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well done, my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.93,0:11:24.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Arinsu-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.77,0:11:30.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Goku!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.06,0:11:35.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Goku-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.82,0:11:41.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like it worked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.45,0:11:43.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.08,0:11:54.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That was a short rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.50,0:11:57.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,H-How dare you!\NI'm the Supreme Demon King!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.63,0:12:01.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And you! I thought you\Nwere supposed to be senile!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.60,0:12:07.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Gomah-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.64,0:12:11.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can repent\Nover the next hundred years in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.43,0:12:12.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.90,0:12:16.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But he didn't try to kill Dende.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.77,0:12:19.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right?! I'm a good guy at heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.73,0:12:21.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.15,0:12:22.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We'll make it 99 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.11,0:12:26.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?! Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.83,0:12:36.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Marba.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.42,0:12:40.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's include Degesu so he has company.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.26,0:12:41.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A splendid idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.60,0:12:51.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is…!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.36,0:13:08.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's snug in there,\Nbut it's pretty nice, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.03,0:13:12.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It has a small garden\Nand all sorts of games for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.66,0:13:16.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-Curses! Gomah-sama, do something!\N-Let me out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.37,0:13:17.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now then…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.17,0:13:20.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Gomah and Degesu are out of the picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.17,0:13:24.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who will be the next Supreme Demon King?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.01,0:13:27.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why don't you take on the role?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.93,0:13:29.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You rank higher than any of your rivals.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.10,0:13:31.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's what you wanted, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.06,0:13:33.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.64,0:13:36.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't expect that from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.77,0:13:41.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I realized that you still retain\Na sliver of a conscience.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.73,0:13:44.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What a disgusting thing to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.90,0:13:46.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let me be clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.95,0:13:50.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My ambitions haven't changed one bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.66,0:13:56.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A terrifying Demon Realm that rivals\Nthe outside world, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.54,0:13:59.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.08,0:14:05.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If I become Supreme Demon King without\Ngaining magic power from the Dragon Balls,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.51,0:14:10.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll just end up getting overthrown\Nby someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.26,0:14:11.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.31,0:14:17.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The one who defeats the Supreme Demon King\Nis the first in line to succeed them!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.61,0:14:23.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.74,0:14:30.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The one who defeats\Nthe Supreme Demon King?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.24,0:14:31.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't that…?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.28,0:14:33.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.70,0:14:35.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.37,0:14:40.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see! It's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.04,0:14:44.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay! I'll do it!\NI'll be Supreme Demon King!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.84,0:14:47.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.80,0:14:48.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.76,0:14:49.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.72,0:14:52.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you understand what you're saying?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.22,0:14:54.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.89,0:14:55.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Arinsu-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.77,0:15:00.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I choose you to be\Nmy Vice-Supreme Demon King!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.27,0:15:01.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,W-What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.90,0:15:05.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm a much better judge of character\Nthan you'd think!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.11,0:15:07.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,U-Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.07,0:15:12.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You are very ambitious,\Nbut at your heart, you're not all bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.70,0:15:15.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your brains and planning\Nare powerful weapons!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.41,0:15:18.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And more importantly, you made me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.33,0:15:20.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Majin Duu will be a Minister!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.42,0:15:23.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Marba and Neva will be, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.42,0:15:24.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.42,0:15:27.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You have knowledge and skill\Nand magic power
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.34,0:15:30.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,and know about the Demon Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.05,0:15:33.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-And Glorio will be a Minister.\N-Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.85,0:15:39.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,For a Majin, you have the rare qualities\Nof good judgment and heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.23,0:15:41.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,King Kadan will be a Minister, too!!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.23,0:15:42.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,M-Me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.60,0:15:43.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.02,0:15:47.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your courage to come to fight\Nfor the Demon Realm is worthy of praise!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.07,0:15:51.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I'm a Majin\Nfrom the Third Demon World!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.65,0:15:53.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've never heard of anything like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.03,0:15:56.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then you're the first Minister\Nfrom the Third Demon World.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.99,0:16:00.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Dad! Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.33,0:16:04.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You people from the outside world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.38,0:16:07.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You people have done amazingly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.42,0:16:09.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is there anyone\Nwho wants to be a Minister?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.72,0:16:13.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, we're goin' home.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.30,0:16:15.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.22,0:16:19.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay then!\NAnyone else wanna be a Minister?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.97,0:16:20.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.10,0:16:23.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, yes, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.10,0:16:26.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.19,0:16:30.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well then! Thus concludes\Nmy perfect assignments!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.61,0:16:32.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Over!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.95,0:16:41.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,H-Hold on a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.50,0:16:44.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He could actually be good at the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.38,0:16:54.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's work to make the Demon Realm\Na scary yet good place to live!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.72,0:16:56.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,R-Right…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.18,0:17:01.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.10,0:17:06.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The new Supreme Demon King is King Kuu!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.73,0:17:09.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No objections here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.79,0:17:23.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bulma-san, here's the Majilite\NI promised you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.25,0:17:28.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It didn't have to be this much.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.13,0:17:29.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.67,0:17:33.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I took all this\Nfrom the warehouse in Gomah's palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.84,0:17:36.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eat these on the way home.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.51,0:17:38.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Chocolate cookies!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.26,0:17:41.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much.\NEven though I can't eat these.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.06,0:17:45.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Blast it! I still say I could've won!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.64,0:17:48.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're still on that? I get it already.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.56,0:17:52.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You were keeping that transformation\Na secret from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.15,0:17:54.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You mean Super Saiyan 4?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.86,0:18:00.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Buu was really strong,\Nso I trained a lot after fightin' him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.62,0:18:04.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wasn't sure if it would work, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.66,0:18:07.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's like a bargain sale of Super Saiyans.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.71,0:18:09.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But you turned Super Saiyan 3, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.71,0:18:15.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up! Th-That transformation was, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.47,0:18:18.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's Ultra Vegeta 1!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.34,0:18:19.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What the heck is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.39,0:18:22.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Dende.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.10,0:18:26.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Have you considered living here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.27,0:18:28.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You could live comfortably.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.35,0:18:33.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, but I have my duties back on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.65,0:18:36.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.44,0:18:37.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Pretty much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.24,0:18:44.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll ask the Nameks who lost Planet Namek\Nand have been reduced to nomads.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.16,0:18:47.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure they'll welcome the idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.21,0:18:50.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see. A wonderful idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.96,0:18:55.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll look forward to that as I wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.30,0:18:59.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Goku.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.88,0:19:00.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're all ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.97,0:19:02.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.35,0:19:05.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Goku-san. Take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.18,0:19:11.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Since the Tunnel's open, wind's pushing\Nthe gas up, making the air lighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.48,0:19:18.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You folks from the outside world\Nhave really helped us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.78,0:19:21.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,From the bottom of my heart, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.91,0:19:24.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll take you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.20,0:19:27.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-Thanks. Let's get goin'.\N-Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.83,0:19:34.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,See you again!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.50,0:19:36.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.00,0:19:40.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If things get hairy again, come save us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.59,0:19:43.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sure! You got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.64,0:19:48.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,See you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.24,0:20:03.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,See you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.95,0:20:12.00,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,Original Work, Story & Character Design\NAkira Toriyama (Shueisha "Jump comics")
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.12,0:20:13.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Hee, hee hee!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.96,0:20:18.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Time to adventure!\NYou'll be hooked for sure!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.05,0:20:23.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The Demon Realm is full of mystery{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.18,0:20:26.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}DAIMA wonderland{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.80,0:20:28.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Whoopsie daisy!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.72,0:20:33.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Even when your heart shrinks\NAnd you feel low{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.14,0:20:37.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Dreams are everywhere\NDon't worry about it{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.69,0:20:40.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Never give up{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.45,0:20:48.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Here comes a New Story{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.28,0:20:52.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Thousands of jabs and silly jokes{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.66,0:20:56.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}They're waitin' for you{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.38,0:21:03.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Jaan! Jaka jaan!\NThe fanfare of courage{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.01,0:21:10.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}No-holds-barred battles\NThe excitement ain't stoppin'{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.93,0:21:17.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Hey Shenron, grant my wish{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.31,0:21:24.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I wanna meet\NSomeone amazin' again tomorrow{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.91,0:21:32.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Minister Gliro.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.66,0:21:34.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you listenin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.12,0:21:35.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.37,0:21:36.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right… What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.54,0:21:40.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Remember where we bought the Medi Bugs?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.88,0:21:42.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can we stop by there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.42,0:21:44.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I suppose so.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.67,0:21:48.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We've been runnin' low on Senzu Beans,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.34,0:21:53.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,so I thought we could buy\Na bunch of those Revive Bug things.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.44,0:22:01.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.19,0:22:02.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.90,0:22:04.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.28,0:22:05.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.28,0:22:08.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? You…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.12,0:22:12.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, aren't you…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.91,0:22:16.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,the kid who bought\Nsome Medi Bugs the other day?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.41,0:22:19.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, they really helped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.25,0:22:21.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You've really grown!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.92,0:22:26.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Or was that a side-effect\Nof the Medi Bugs?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.68,0:22:28.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.93,0:22:31.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.43,0:22:33.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.85,0:22:37.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bugs?! Ewww! Disgusting!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.52,0:22:39.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How can you eat those things?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.98,0:22:44.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, well, Medi Bugs definitely work.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.86,0:22:46.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Achichi Bugs will heal burns.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.86,0:22:49.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Beaut Bugs will make your skin supple.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.49,0:22:51.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Beaut Bugs do what?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.62,0:22:55.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eat one and it'll\Nde-age your skin ten years.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.24,0:22:56.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.50,0:22:59.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll take all of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.34,0:23:05.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.25,0:23:06.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.51,0:23:14.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Lady, are these…?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.89,0:23:19.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah. They're Tertian Oculuses\Ncalled Evil Third Eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.56,0:23:20.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.56,0:23:26.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you place one in your forehead\Nit'll give you tremendous strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.98,0:23:28.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I had three of them,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.74,0:23:34.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,but they're pretty suspicious and pricy,\Nso I only managed to sell one long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.08,0:23:38.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you want one, I'll give you a discount.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.66,0:23:41.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.87,0:23:45.38,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,THE END
